F34 said 31. Now 34 with cmd.oo, test.oo, and os/env.oo. Transient `core/_f40_*.oo` probes are gone.

========================================================================
RUBRIC
========================================================================

- **REAL** — named job has a working body (thin builtin wrappers count).
- **PARTIAL** — mix of working + residual, or a subset of the named job.
- **STUB** — fail-closed / hardcoded fixture / always-err / detect theater.
- **PHANTOM** — claimed; **not on disk**.

`process_exit(1) only` = every exec line is `process_exit`. Product: **0**.

