Product class totals: **REAL 15 · PARTIAL 13 · STUB 6 · PHANTOM 0 (on disk)**.

Product `process_exit(1)`: **3 files** (`core/crypto.oo` `aes_encrypt` + 1 other, `hash/sha256.oo` stub, `test.oo` test-runner fail-closed).
Product `UNIMPLEMENTED_RESIDUAL` string: `markup/{json_schema,toml,xml,yaml}` residual paths (6 hits). `hash/sha256.oo` uses `process_exit(1)`, not `UNIMPLEMENTED_RESIDUAL`.
No product file is process_exit-only.

Twins (count as 2 files each): `option`/`core/option` identical;
`str`/`core/str` near-twin; `result` is a superset of `core/result`.

